* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
* Target cell
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------

* sg13cmos5l_IOPadInOut30mA
.subckt sg13cmos5l_IOPadInOut30mA vss vdd iovss iovdd p2c c2p c2p_en pad
Xnclamp iovss iovdd pad ngate sg13cmos5l_Clamp_N15N15D
Xpclamp iovss iovdd pad pgate sg13cmos5l_Clamp_P15N15D
Xdcndiode iovss pad iovdd sg13cmos5l_DCNDiode
Xdcpdiode pad iovdd iovss sg13cmos5l_DCPDiode
Xgatedec vdd vss iovdd c2p c2p_en ngate pgate sg13cmos5l_GateDecode
Xleveldown vdd vss iovdd iovss pad p2c sg13cmos5l_LevelDown
.ends sg13cmos5l_IOPadInOut30mA
